# Precise Redaction aimed at Bot1's Dark Ritual, with Bot2's own Counterspell stacked above it on the same Dark Ritual
# (CR 608.2b): Counterspell resolves first and counters it, so when Precise Redaction resolves its target is gone and it
# does nothing - it is not countered itself, and goes to the graveyard after Counterspell. Bot1's Dark Ritual made no mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dark Ritual
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Precise Redaction
Counterspell
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Precise Redaction.Cast(Stack.Dark Ritual)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Counterspell.Cast(Stack.Dark Ritual)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
